WEBVTT

00:00:28.236 --> 00:00:31.448
THE WAY OF THE HOUSEHUSBAND

00:01:42.018 --> 00:01:42.852
EPISODE 73

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:44.103
CREPES

00:01:44.187 --> 00:01:45.063
SNIFF

00:01:45.146 --> 00:01:47.357
Business is slow today.

00:01:48.149 --> 00:01:48.983
Huh?

00:01:49.067 --> 00:01:50.568
Over there!

00:01:50.652 --> 00:01:52.904
It's the donut truck
everyone is talking about!

00:01:52.987 --> 00:01:54.531
Three double-chocolates please!

00:01:54.614 --> 00:01:57.742
Okay, next customer! What'll it be?

00:01:57.826 --> 00:02:01.496
What the hell?
That place nicked all my customers!

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:05.333
Hang on. Is that you, Koharu?!

00:02:05.416 --> 00:02:07.752
As annoying as ever, big bro.

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:12.423
A donut truck?
What are you thinking, Koharu?!

00:02:12.507 --> 00:02:15.718
Lovely Donuts.
Fast, cheap, and cute as hell!

00:02:15.802 --> 00:02:17.637
They're a hit with the youngsters.

00:02:18.221 --> 00:02:20.473
You left home to join the Yakuza.

00:02:20.557 --> 00:02:22.600
You have no right to say anything!

00:02:22.684 --> 00:02:25.603
-I'd like a donut, please.
-Coming up!

00:02:27.856 --> 00:02:29.941
-Thanks for waiting!
-What?! So fast!

00:02:30.024 --> 00:02:32.735
We're in a different league
than your crepe shop.

00:02:32.819 --> 00:02:34.070
What did you say?!

00:02:34.153 --> 00:02:38.616
It's a franchise of Lovely Donuts
based in none other than Silicon Valley!

00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:41.828
You mean you're backed
by an extensive organization?!

00:02:41.911 --> 00:02:44.205
-Four crispies, please!
-Coming right up!

00:02:44.289 --> 00:02:46.291
-Three chocolates for me.
-Sure thing!

00:02:46.875 --> 00:02:49.002
By utilizing Lovely Donuts' expertise,

00:02:49.711 --> 00:02:53.965
I'm able to provide pre-prepared,
high-quality donuts cheaply and quickly.

00:02:54.048 --> 00:02:56.926
It's a whole different ball game
than your "play truck."

00:02:58.970 --> 00:03:02.724
Missy. Can I get a donut too?

00:03:02.807 --> 00:03:04.350
Tatsu?!

00:03:07.228 --> 00:03:08.354
Here you go.

00:03:08.438 --> 00:03:09.272
NOM

00:03:11.399 --> 00:03:13.026
-Just as I suspected.
-Huh?

00:03:13.109 --> 00:03:15.987
Something's missing from this donut.

00:03:16.070 --> 00:03:17.739
What are you talking about?

00:03:17.822 --> 00:03:20.199
Got a problem
with what Lovely Donuts has to offer?

00:03:20.742 --> 00:03:22.243
Tora, I'm using your truck.

00:03:22.327 --> 00:03:23.411
Huh? What for?

00:03:23.494 --> 00:03:24.329
BANG

00:03:25.330 --> 00:03:26.331
GLUG GLUG

00:03:26.414 --> 00:03:27.665
FZZZZ

00:03:27.749 --> 00:03:29.292
Wow, sounds so pleasant!

00:03:29.375 --> 00:03:30.877
Such a delicious smell too.

00:03:34.464 --> 00:03:35.298
Have a taste.

00:03:36.132 --> 00:03:38.718
What's with the plain donut?

00:03:38.801 --> 00:03:40.553
What's so special about this?

00:03:43.306 --> 00:03:45.183
Whoa, it's delicious!

00:03:45.808 --> 00:03:49.103
It's crispy on the outside,
fluffy and warm on the inside.

00:03:49.187 --> 00:03:51.397
The aroma of butter is sweet and rich too!

00:03:52.106 --> 00:03:56.152
My donuts seem
a little oily in comparison.

00:03:56.694 --> 00:03:58.112
Barely any aroma either.

00:03:58.196 --> 00:04:02.200
When made to order,
it can thrill all of a customer's senses.

00:04:02.283 --> 00:04:06.371
That's not easy to do with factory-made
fare that puts quantity over quality,

00:04:06.454 --> 00:04:09.082
though sure, if you cut costs,
you can sell it cheap.

00:04:10.124 --> 00:04:12.961
Food that's painstakingly crafted
one-by-one delivers great taste,

00:04:13.044 --> 00:04:15.463
and the love and care that went into it.

00:04:16.673 --> 00:04:19.300
This donut has none of that!

00:04:19.384 --> 00:04:20.760
THUD

00:04:21.344 --> 00:04:22.971
Koharu! Pull yourself together!

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:24.847
The truth is,

00:04:25.974 --> 00:04:27.183
back when we were kids,

00:04:27.892 --> 00:04:31.187
I loved those donuts we ate together.

00:04:31.771 --> 00:04:35.066
I started this
because I couldn't forget that memory.

00:04:36.985 --> 00:04:38.945
Where did I go wrong?

00:04:39.862 --> 00:04:40.697
I just

00:04:41.239 --> 00:04:45.368
wanted my big brother to acknowledge me.

00:04:46.077 --> 00:04:47.829
Hey, Koharu?

00:04:48.413 --> 00:04:50.540
Koharu!

00:04:50.623 --> 00:04:52.083
Are the donuts ready yet?

00:04:52.166 --> 00:04:57.088
Koharu!

00:04:58.464 --> 00:04:59.799
It's chilly today.

00:05:00.591 --> 00:05:02.969
Miku, it's morning. Time to get up.

00:05:04.345 --> 00:05:05.680
What the hell is this?!

00:05:05.763 --> 00:05:07.098
What's wrong?

00:05:08.599 --> 00:05:09.559
What is it?

00:05:09.642 --> 00:05:11.769
Wow, look at all the snow!

00:05:11.853 --> 00:05:14.230
-Look at this condensation!
-That's what you meant?

00:05:14.314 --> 00:05:17.942
Left alone, condensation
can lead to mold and decay.

00:05:18.026 --> 00:05:21.654
Gotta whack them the moment you find 'em!

00:05:21.738 --> 00:05:24.866
I got an anti-condensation squeegee
for this very occasion!

00:05:24.949 --> 00:05:26.868
SQUEAK SQUEAK

00:05:28.411 --> 00:05:29.829
It's wiping it up so well!

00:05:29.912 --> 00:05:33.291
This effective at only 400 yen?
What an exquisite product!

00:05:33.374 --> 00:05:35.501
Gin, this is your first snow, isn't it?

00:05:37.545 --> 00:05:38.504
SLIP

00:05:40.381 --> 00:05:41.215
What?

00:05:42.592 --> 00:05:45.511
Since it snowed,
I'm going to head out early to work.

00:05:45.595 --> 00:05:47.055
Take care not to slip.

00:05:48.431 --> 00:05:51.976
If it's going to snow again later,
I should grocery shop now.

00:05:52.643 --> 00:05:53.644
HEIWA MART

00:05:55.938 --> 00:05:56.814
DUFF

00:05:58.858 --> 00:06:01.944
Boss, my shoes keep slipping!

00:06:02.028 --> 00:06:04.822
What? Quit whining!

00:06:04.906 --> 00:06:07.075
Huh? Whaddya lookin' at?!

00:06:07.158 --> 00:06:08.409
SLIP, THUD

00:06:08.493 --> 00:06:09.452
-Boss!
-Boss!

00:06:09.535 --> 00:06:12.789
Idiots. If you're wearing dress shoes,
use this!

00:06:12.872 --> 00:06:15.583
The spikes firmly grip the snow and ice!

00:06:15.666 --> 00:06:17.794
Appropriate in any business context!

00:06:17.877 --> 00:06:20.129
-Whoa!
-Boss! You're up!

00:06:20.213 --> 00:06:23.091
And this little piece
ain't even worth mentioning.

00:06:23.674 --> 00:06:26.469
I'll contact a hardware dealer I know.

00:06:27.053 --> 00:06:28.805
KUNIMI KOGYO OFFICES

00:06:29.722 --> 00:06:30.807
Sorry for the wait.

00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:32.517
What's that?

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:34.477
The mother lode of snow scoops!

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:36.562
-The mother lode?!
-The mother lode?!

00:06:36.646 --> 00:06:39.023
Load it little by little using a shovel,

00:06:39.107 --> 00:06:41.984
then you can move the haul all at once.

00:06:42.568 --> 00:06:44.445
-Wow, incredible!
-So much easier!

00:06:44.529 --> 00:06:47.490
Just keep stockpiling
and transporting with this.

00:06:48.741 --> 00:06:50.868
See ya. Don't be catching colds!

00:06:53.913 --> 00:06:56.332
That should about do it.

00:06:56.415 --> 00:06:59.001
What? We still got stuff to do.

00:06:59.669 --> 00:07:00.711
Take this!

00:07:00.795 --> 00:07:02.839
SCOOP

00:07:03.840 --> 00:07:05.299
This is surprisingly toasty.

00:07:10.388 --> 00:07:11.764
EPISODE 75

00:07:11.848 --> 00:07:14.600
POP POP POP

00:07:17.603 --> 00:07:20.982
Almost there. It's turning into popcorn.

00:07:21.065 --> 00:07:24.068
It's pretty easy to make popcorn
in a frying pan, huh?

00:07:24.152 --> 00:07:27.780
Yeah, you just need butter and dried corn.

00:07:27.864 --> 00:07:29.699
Water and sugar for caramel flavor.

00:07:29.782 --> 00:07:32.034
Isn't the sound of popping corn great?

00:07:32.118 --> 00:07:33.911
Yeah, brings back memories…

00:07:33.995 --> 00:07:35.288
of raids.

00:07:36.414 --> 00:07:38.374
Okay, it's decision time!

00:07:38.958 --> 00:07:42.628
What will we watch
for our inaugural DVD screening party?

00:07:42.712 --> 00:07:46.549
Ahem! The first-gen Crimecatch Policure!
This one's not to be missed!

00:07:46.632 --> 00:07:49.802
Or how about Crimecatch Policure:
House-Search MAX?!

00:07:49.886 --> 00:07:53.347
Or this one,
Crimecatch Policure: Mobster Star!

00:07:53.431 --> 00:07:54.765
Aren't they all the same?

00:07:55.766 --> 00:07:57.226
The same?

00:07:57.810 --> 00:08:00.313
You're familiar
with Crimecatch Policure, of course.

00:08:00.396 --> 00:08:04.066
Everyone knows it's a masterpiece that
transformed the very idea of morning TV.

00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:09.030
Season two, House-Search MAX, introduced
additional officers to Policure's ranks

00:08:09.113 --> 00:08:11.199
and the series grew in popularity.

00:08:11.282 --> 00:08:14.410
Then comes none other
than the third season, Mobster Star,

00:08:14.494 --> 00:08:17.997
which sees our two heroes
climbing to the executive ranks and…

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:19.415
What about you, Boss?

00:08:19.499 --> 00:08:21.334
I'm glad you asked.

00:08:21.834 --> 00:08:24.962
Who doesn't recognize the masterpiece,
It's Tough Being a Guy?

00:08:25.046 --> 00:08:26.714
Oh, that's great!

00:08:26.797 --> 00:08:28.925
And here's
It's Tough Being a Guy: Continued.

00:08:29.550 --> 00:08:31.761
Then there's
It's Tough Being a Guy: A New Era,

00:08:31.844 --> 00:08:35.765
It's Tough Being a Guy: Pure Love Edition,
also the Wistful Longing Edition.

00:08:35.848 --> 00:08:40.311
Journey of the Heart, Youth, A Sojourn
Overseas, The Returning Traveler,

00:08:40.394 --> 00:08:42.271
A Proposal, A Proposal: Part Two…

00:08:42.355 --> 00:08:43.272
That's a lot.

00:08:43.356 --> 00:08:45.191
These ones are practically the same.

00:08:45.274 --> 00:08:46.692
Idiot. Look properly.

00:08:46.776 --> 00:08:49.779
The protagonist becomes
more and more dignified.

00:08:49.862 --> 00:08:52.615
Incidentally, the ninth episode script
of the third season

00:08:52.698 --> 00:08:55.576
was written by the now-famous
screenwriter, Takahashi,

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:57.995
and immediately after the broadcast…

00:08:58.079 --> 00:09:02.458
Both of your choices are too big.
They're too daunting to want to watch.

00:09:03.042 --> 00:09:05.878
I may not look it,
but I've seen a broad range of films.

00:09:05.962 --> 00:09:07.171
Just leave it to me.

00:09:08.047 --> 00:09:09.924
Yakuza vs. Anaconda!

00:09:10.675 --> 00:09:12.677
Yakuza vs. Angry Ghost!

00:09:13.511 --> 00:09:15.388
Yakuza vs. Dragon!

00:09:15.471 --> 00:09:16.681
How is that "broad"?

00:09:17.265 --> 00:09:19.517
They're all totally different genres!

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:23.896
The storylines are…
What happened again? Yeah.

00:09:24.605 --> 00:09:27.108
Anyway, they're different!
I can say that at least!

00:09:27.191 --> 00:09:28.651
It's gotta be Policure.

00:09:28.734 --> 00:09:30.319
No, It's Tough Being a Guy!

00:09:30.403 --> 00:09:31.320
Something Yakuza!

00:09:31.404 --> 00:09:33.155
Yours is out, Masa.

00:09:33.239 --> 00:09:34.532
What, why?!

00:09:34.615 --> 00:09:35.741
ONE HOUR LATER

00:09:35.825 --> 00:09:39.954
All right, to accommodate
everyone's opinions,

00:09:40.037 --> 00:09:41.455
we've settled on Lion Queen.

00:09:41.539 --> 00:09:44.125
-Okay.
-Sure, whatever.

00:09:44.208 --> 00:09:45.209
They're over it.

00:09:45.835 --> 00:09:49.297
Actually, you wanna watch
the dubbed or the subtitled version?

00:09:49.380 --> 00:09:51.173
-Dubbed!
-Subtitled, obviously.

00:09:51.257 --> 00:09:54.844
But I wanna focus on the visuals!
And I like the voice actors too!

00:09:54.927 --> 00:09:57.430
It's all about
the original actors' acting.

00:09:57.513 --> 00:09:59.765
I shouldn't have asked.

00:10:00.266 --> 00:10:05.187
LIMITED EDITION SLEEVE CASE
CRIMECATCH POLICURE HOUSE-SEARCH MAX

00:10:05.271 --> 00:10:07.023
EPISODE 76

00:10:11.360 --> 00:10:15.281
Come on, Pea Shoot.
Check out the fresh stuff.

00:10:15.364 --> 00:10:18.993
A coworker asked me
to look after this hamster…

00:10:20.786 --> 00:10:22.413
But we've got Gin…

00:10:25.916 --> 00:10:27.793
Right, we can't do it.

00:10:29.170 --> 00:10:30.296
A hamster?

00:10:30.379 --> 00:10:33.716
If it's you asking, Boss,
of course I'll take him in!

00:10:33.799 --> 00:10:35.718
Wonder what hamsters eat?

00:10:36.552 --> 00:10:39.513
I've only got 500 yen this month.
Should be fine, right?

00:10:39.597 --> 00:10:40.431
Nope.

00:10:43.809 --> 00:10:48.189
Boss, this fella's got nowhere to go.
May I ask you for your help?

00:10:50.733 --> 00:10:54.737
First he's gotta get Pinky's approval.

00:10:55.946 --> 00:10:59.200
Looky, Pinky-poo! It's a hamster!

00:10:59.283 --> 00:11:00.117
CHOMP

00:11:00.826 --> 00:11:02.161
Pinky!

00:11:02.995 --> 00:11:04.121
Sorry, Tatsu.

00:11:04.997 --> 00:11:09.168
No one who attacks Pinky can live here.

00:11:11.712 --> 00:11:13.881
Sorry, Pea Shoot.

00:11:14.548 --> 00:11:16.342
Here you go, have some fresh greens.

00:11:17.259 --> 00:11:18.886
Mind if we have a little chat?

00:11:18.969 --> 00:11:20.179
What have you got there?

00:11:20.262 --> 00:11:21.472
Cops!

00:11:21.555 --> 00:11:24.850
I won't hand lil' Shoot to the cops.
I'll figure something out!

00:11:25.601 --> 00:11:26.811
Did he say "shoot"?!

00:11:26.894 --> 00:11:28.437
He's got a weapon!

00:11:28.521 --> 00:11:29.688
Hold it right there!

00:11:29.772 --> 00:11:31.023
Don't run, you bastard!

00:11:31.107 --> 00:11:33.484
Everyone, stay back! It's dangerous!

00:11:33.567 --> 00:11:35.444
All right, hand over what you've got!

00:11:36.737 --> 00:11:38.364
What the heck is this?!

00:11:38.989 --> 00:11:40.074
It's freakin' cute!

00:11:40.157 --> 00:11:42.326
Explain yourself, now!

00:11:42.410 --> 00:11:44.328
This is Pea Shoot, a hamster.

00:11:45.079 --> 00:11:46.997
I'm trying to find him a home.

00:11:53.003 --> 00:11:54.130
Go!

00:11:54.714 --> 00:11:55.548
Cheers.

00:11:57.216 --> 00:11:58.968
In that case, I can--

00:11:59.051 --> 00:12:00.720
I'll take him.

00:12:05.808 --> 00:12:06.767
EPISODE 77

00:12:06.851 --> 00:12:07.685
HEIWA MART

00:12:10.855 --> 00:12:12.523
Fancy seeing you here, Tatsu!

00:12:12.606 --> 00:12:14.483
The crepe guy's here again today.

00:12:14.567 --> 00:12:16.193
Oh, it's you, Tora.

00:12:17.319 --> 00:12:19.405
I got hold of some pretty unreal stuff.

00:12:19.488 --> 00:12:21.991
It'll get five people toasted in one go.

00:12:22.074 --> 00:12:23.701
Five in one go?!

00:12:23.784 --> 00:12:26.162
I'll let you have a taste too.

00:12:26.829 --> 00:12:28.622
Not here, though.

00:12:28.706 --> 00:12:30.624
Meet me in the mountains this weekend.

00:12:30.708 --> 00:12:32.626
One chocolate crepe, please.

00:12:32.710 --> 00:12:33.836
KATAGI CAMPING GROUND

00:12:36.547 --> 00:12:38.132
You're right, this is nuts.

00:12:38.215 --> 00:12:39.759
Yeah, it's incredible.

00:12:39.842 --> 00:12:41.302
Gets you toasted, right?

00:12:41.385 --> 00:12:43.220
Bro, what is this?

00:12:45.264 --> 00:12:47.725
A tent sauna by the river.

00:12:47.808 --> 00:12:48.642
Nice.

00:12:48.726 --> 00:12:52.605
Barely anyone knows about this place.
No need to worry about people.

00:12:53.189 --> 00:12:56.066
Work up a sweat surrounded by nature.
Cool off in the river.

00:12:56.150 --> 00:12:59.778
Keep repeating the cycle and the line
between you and your surroundings blurs.

00:12:59.862 --> 00:13:02.239
You can become one with nature.

00:13:02.823 --> 00:13:06.702
Sheesh. You called me
all the way here just for a sauna?

00:13:07.578 --> 00:13:10.164
Didn't think my brother had friends.

00:13:11.207 --> 00:13:12.374
Good for him.

00:13:12.958 --> 00:13:15.753
Hey, Tora. Is that it?

00:13:17.129 --> 00:13:18.714
Who do you think you're talking to?

00:13:18.798 --> 00:13:21.175
-It's what the Finns term löyly.
-"Löyly"?

00:13:21.258 --> 00:13:25.387
Throw scented water onto the stones
to create the hottest steam ever!

00:13:25.471 --> 00:13:27.848
Oh, what a lovely lemon scent!

00:13:28.432 --> 00:13:29.808
I'm pouring sweat!

00:13:29.892 --> 00:13:32.812
Fan with a towel to heighten its effects!

00:13:32.895 --> 00:13:35.397
What's the matter?
That's nowhere near enough!

00:13:35.481 --> 00:13:37.149
You need to fan harder!

00:13:37.233 --> 00:13:38.734
Space is tight!

00:13:38.817 --> 00:13:39.735
Ouch!

00:13:39.818 --> 00:13:40.694
THWACK

00:13:40.778 --> 00:13:41.946
THWACK THWACK

00:13:42.029 --> 00:13:43.322
Hey, quit it!

00:13:48.118 --> 00:13:50.704
This is no sweat.

00:13:50.788 --> 00:13:52.289
Still got more to come.

00:13:54.041 --> 00:13:54.875
-Idiots.
-Idiots.

00:13:55.709 --> 00:13:57.836
Something wrong?

00:13:58.712 --> 00:14:00.548
You've gotta be kidding…

00:14:01.757 --> 00:14:04.510
-Tatsu, there's a sale today!
-Let's go take a look!

00:14:06.053 --> 00:14:08.472
-I heard that crepe place is good!
-Wanna go?

00:14:09.056 --> 00:14:12.476
-Oh, really? Yes, let's go!
-Yeah, I'll come along!

00:14:12.977 --> 00:14:14.186
You're not going anywhere!

00:14:17.231 --> 00:14:19.024
This feels good!

00:14:19.108 --> 00:14:20.150
Yeah…

00:14:25.948 --> 00:14:27.866
Far from the hustle and bustle
of the city,

00:14:28.492 --> 00:14:30.578
alone and surrounded by nature,

00:14:31.161 --> 00:14:33.038
a moment of leisure.

00:14:33.914 --> 00:14:37.668
When night comes,
the fire reveals its many faces.

00:14:38.711 --> 00:14:40.963
Why does it feel so enjoyable?

00:14:42.047 --> 00:14:42.923
CLINK

00:14:43.674 --> 00:14:46.135
The 12-year Glenfiddich.

00:14:46.719 --> 00:14:48.554
A single malt whiskey.

00:14:49.430 --> 00:14:53.183
A smooth finish,
with an aroma from matured casks…

00:14:53.976 --> 00:14:55.436
When it hits the throat--

00:15:02.902 --> 00:15:05.029
Ah, what fine weather.

00:15:05.654 --> 00:15:09.366
I had a bit too much to drink last night,
but I feel unbelievably good today.

00:15:10.075 --> 00:15:12.578
Some light fare like this
suits me this morning.

00:15:12.661 --> 00:15:13.787
"COFFEE KAN" ROASTERY

00:15:13.871 --> 00:15:14.705
GRIND GRIND

00:15:14.788 --> 00:15:16.665
But I can't do without coffee.

00:15:17.374 --> 00:15:18.250
This sound…

00:15:18.334 --> 00:15:19.251
TAP TAP

00:15:19.335 --> 00:15:20.252
FZZZZ

00:15:22.755 --> 00:15:24.173
What pleasurable aroma…

00:15:27.968 --> 00:15:29.094
Poured too much.

00:15:30.054 --> 00:15:31.305
But that's fine…

00:15:31.388 --> 00:15:32.514
Too hot!
